    "chunk_text": "nygon si\u00f0an in \u00fe\u00e6t eare \u00feis galdor & pater noster \u00e6ne. \u00deis ylce galdor m\u00e6g mon singan wi\u00f0 smeogan wyrme, sing gelome on \u00fea dolh, & mid \u00f0inan spatle Wi\u00f0 \u00f0on \u00f0e mon attor gedrince, nim marubian s\u00e6d, m\u00e6ngc wi\u00f0 wine, syle drincan. \u00deis is se halga dr\u00e6nc wi\u00f0 \u00e6lfsidene & wi\u00f0 eallum feondes costungum, writ on husldisce, In principio Nim cristallan & disman & sidewaran & cassuc & finol, & nim sester fulne gehalgodes wines, & hat Ber \u00feonne to ciricean, l\u00e6t singan m\u00e6ssan ofer, ane omnibus sanctis o\u00f0re Contra tribulatione, \u00feriddan To wensealfe, Nim elenan & r\u00e6dic, cyrfillan & hr\u00e6mnes fot, \u00e6ngliscne n\u00e6p & finul & saluian & To godre bansealfe \u00fee m\u00e6g wi\u00f0 heafodece & wi\u00f0 ealra lyma tyddernysse, sceal rude, r\u00e6dic & ampre, & nim \u00e6scrinde & weliges twiga & acrinde & wirrinde & surre apoldrerinde & seales rinde & Nim \u00feonne heortes smera & h\u00e6feres smera & eald morod & fearres smeru & bares smeru & rammes Nim \u00feonne nygon clufa garleaces gehalgodes, cnuca on wine, wring \u00feurh cla\u00f0, scaf on myrran \u00fea Sing \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6rofer, Benedictus dominus deus meus & \u00feone o\u00feerne benedictus dominus deus israel, Gif poc sy on eagan, nim mearhsapan & hinde meoluc, m\u00e6ng tosomne & swyng, l\u00e6t standan o\u00f0 hit Nim clatan moran, cn",
